# Frontend (Zap)

- App: Next.js in `apps/web/`; NEAR access via `@uc/chain` (`near-kit`) and API routes.
- Checkout uses receipt keys (browser ed25519), not wallet selector for customers — see `packages/chain/src/receipt-key.ts`.
- Seller flows: operator relayer today; wallet selector planned (README “Planned”).
- Env/network: follow `scripts/demo.ts` (local sandbox) vs `docs/GO-LIVE.md` (mainnet).
- For new wallet UX, follow `.agents/skills/near-dapp/` and `.cursor/skills/near-wallet-auth/`.
- Amounts: USDC 6 decimals on NEAR; gas/deposits via executor, not checkout UI.
